  "description": "A bubble, playful and sweet font with a graffiti vibe and soft, rounded shapes in detail. Line Gravity brings a fun and casual energy, perfect for large-scale applications like posters, flyers, or street-inspired designs. It pairs well with sans fonts, making it versatile for modern layouts. Its hand-drawn imperfections keep it lively while still providing clear legibility. A perfect blend of retro charm and urban style.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>A bubble, playful and sweet font with a graffiti vibe and soft, rounded shapes in detail. Line Gravity brings a fun and casual energy, perfect for large-scale applications like posters, flyers, or street-inspired designs. It pairs well with sans fonts, making it versatile for modern layouts. Its hand-drawn imperfections keep it lively while still providing clear legibility. A perfect blend of retro charm and urban style.</p>",
